  "reason": "The only completed experiment is an RNA-only PCA single-profile baseline with modest accuracy (0.485), so there is no evidence yet about whether image features are informative. Testing image-only ResNet-50 with a single profile establishes a simple unimodal baseline for the image modality and reduces uncertainty about a top-level design choice: whether to invest in multimodal fusion at all. This is preferable to immediately testing multiprofile, transformer aggregation, or multimodal fusion because it avoids changing several complex design choices at once and will clarify whether image performance justifies later fusion experiments."
}

